# T123 (story 5): app-03 was put on the reader by hand and its files equal the catalog package: Check shows the adoption plan, Adopt writes only the record.
# scenario demo
# expect-file system/pbstore/installed/app-03.json
# expect-file applications/app-03.bin
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap appRow 2
waitfor detailState Installed outside the store
tap actionCheck
waitfor planSummary App app-03
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor resultText
expect resultText App app-03 is now managed by PB Store
tap ok
waitfor appRow
quit
